{"name":"Sinister Minister","hex":"#353331","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sinister","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Inauspicious, ominous, unlucky, illegitimate.","Evil or seemingly evil; indicating lurking danger or harm."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sinister"},{"term":"minister","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who is trained to preach, to perform religious ceremonies, and to afford pastoral care at a Protestant church.","A person (either a layperson or an ordained clergy member) who is commissioned to perform some act on behalf of the Catholic Church."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To attend to (the needs of); to tend; to take care (of); to give aid; to give service.","To function as a clergyman or as the officiant in church worship."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/minister"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sinister Minister (horse)","blocks":[{"text":"Sinister Minister is a thoroughbred race horse. As a foal born on March 29, 2003, he was a possible contender for the American Triple Crown in 2006."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/%E7%A8%AE%E7%89%A1%E9%A6%AC%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E3%82%B7%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%282020%E5%B9%B410%E6%9C%88%E6%92%AE%E5%BD%B1%29.jpg/330px-%E7%A8%AE%E7%89%A1%E9%A6%AC%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E3%82%B7%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%282020%E5%B9%B410%E6%9C%88%E6%92%AE%E5%BD%B1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinister_Minister_(horse)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/%E7%A8%AE%E7%89%A1%E9%A6%AC%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E3%82%B7%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%282020%E5%B9%B410%E6%9C%88%E6%92%AE%E5%BD%B1%29.jpg/50